      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرِبٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرِيبٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also (tropical:)  <i>Angry:</i> (A:) or
<i>violently angry:</i> (S, K:) applied to a man and
